#: projects/k3bfillstatusdisplay.cpp:571
msgid ""
"<p><b>Why does K3b offer 4.4 GB and 8.0 GB instead of 4.7 and 8.5 like it "
"says on the media?</b><p>A single layer DVD media has a capacity of "
"approximately 4.4 GB which equals 4.4*1024<sup>3</sup> bytes. Media "
"producers just calculate with 1000 instead of 1024 for advertising reasons."
"<br>This results in 4.4*1024<sup>3</sup>/1000<sup>3</sup> = 4.7 GB."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>¿Porqué K3b ufierta 4,4 GB y 8,0 GB en vez de 4,7 y 8,5 tal y como "
"s'indica nel propiu mediu?</b><p>Un DVD de capa simple tien una capacidá "
"aproximada de 4,4 GB qu'equival a 4,4*1.024<sup>3</sup> bytes. Los "
"productores de medios usen 1.000 en vez de 1.024 por razones publicitaries."
"<br>Esti resultáu en 4,4*1.024<sup>3</sup>/1.000<sup>3</sup> = 4,7 GB."

