"destinos escoyeráse al debalu."

#: projects/k3bvcdtrackdialog.cpp:267
msgid ""
"<p>When reactivity is set to delayed, it is recommended that the length of "
"the referenced 'play track' is not more than 5 seconds.<p>The recommended "
"setting for a play item consisting of one still picture and no audio is to "
"loop once and have a delayed reactivity."
msgstr ""
"<p>Cuando la reactividá se defina como retrasada, recomiéndase que la "
"duración de la 'pista a reproducir' referenciada nun dure más de 5 segundos."
"<p>La configuración recomendada pa un elementu de reproducción que consista "
"nuna imaxe fixa y ensin audio ye facer un bucle y tener una reactividá "
"retrasada."

#: projects/k3bvcdtrackdialog.cpp:271
msgid ""
"These are actually pseudo keys, representing the numeric keys 0, 1, ..., 9."
